WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:08.600
Open the financial statements for any period, compare with last year or the budget, and export them.

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.230
All the financial reports are in one place, under Reports.

3
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:21.820
Profit and loss, balance sheet, cash flow, trial balance, the general ledger, VAT and the ageing of what is owed.

4
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.850
Open the profit and loss.

5
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:31.750
Choose the period. It starts on the first day of the fiscal year.

6
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:36.180
Compare with the budget, or with last year.

7
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:43.100
Every line opens the account, down to the entries behind the number.

8
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.990
Or show it by month to see the trend.

9
00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:55.510
Print it, or export it to a spreadsheet for the auditor or the owner.

10
00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:01.930
The trial balance lists every account: opening, movement and closing. Debits and credits always agree.
